    end

    Setup --> Loop[Void Loop: Vacío]

---------------------------------Flujo
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario/Dashboard
    participant Broker as MQTT Broker
    participant ESP as ESP32 (TaskMqttReconnect)
    participant Parser as Callback (JSON)
    participant Logic as Lógica (Functions)
    participant HW as Hardware (Relays/Dimmer)
    participant SPIFFS as Memoria (Settings)

    Note over User, HW: Ejemplo: Encender Relay 1
    
    User->>Broker: Publica JSON {"type":"RELAYS", ...} en "Plc/Esp32"
    Broker->>ESP: Notifica nuevo mensaje (subscribe)
    ESP->>Parser: callback(topic, payload)
    
    activate Parser
    Parser->>Parser: Deserializar JSON
    
    alt JSON Inválido o Propio
        Parser-->>ESP: Retorna Error / Ignora
    else Comando POST Correcto
        Parser->>Logic: apiPostOnOffRelays(data)
        
        activate Logic
        Logic->>HW: digitalWrite(RELAY1, HIGH)
        Logic->>Logic: Actualizar variable estado
        Logic-->>Parser: Retorna true (Éxito)
        deactivate Logic
        
        Parser->>SPIFFS: settingsSave() (Persistir estado)
        SPIFFS-->>Parser: OK
        
        Parser->>Broker: Publica Respuesta {"value": true} en "Plc/Esp32/response"
        Parser->>Broker: Publica Estado General actualizado en "Plc/Esp32"
    end
    deactivate Parser

    Note over ESP, Broker: El ciclo se repite para Dimmer, Restart, etc.

